{"seq":2,"slug":"type-inference","title":"类型推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/type-checking-semantic-analysis/type-checking/type-inference","wordCount":1602,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"类型推断\">类型推断</h1><p><code>let id = x =&gt; x</code> 这一行里没有一个类型注解，Haskell、OCaml 却能告诉你 <code>id</code> 的类型是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall a.\\ a \\to a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>。这不是猜，是算——一套从 1970 年代沿用至今的算法，能在程序员一个注解都不写的情况下，推出每个表达式可能拥有的最一般类型。Hindley-Milner 类型系统与它的实现 Algorithm W 是这门手艺的奠基之作，至今仍是 ML 家族、Rust 局部推断、TypeScript 上下文推断背后共通的内核。本篇把这台机器拆开来看。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>类型推断的目标，是为 <a href=\"type-rules-judgments\">类型规则与判断</a> 里那些「假设你已知道类型」的规则补上缺失的类型。Hindley-Milner（HM）的思路分三步：给每个未知类型引入一个<strong>类型变量</strong>，沿语法结构<strong>收集约束</strong>（哪些类型变量必须相等），再用<strong>合一</strong>（unification）求解这组约束。求解的结果若仍含自由类型变量，就<strong>泛化</strong>成多态类型（type scheme），如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall a.\\ a \\to a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[表达式 AST] --&gt; B[为每个子式引入新类型变量]&#10;  B --&gt; C[遍历 AST 按类型规则收集等式约束]&#10;  C --&gt; D[合一: 求解约束&lt;br/&gt;构造最一般代换 MGU]&#10;  D --&gt;|失败| E[类型错误&lt;br/&gt;occurs-check 或冲突]&#10;  D --&gt;|成功| F[把代换作用到类型变量]&#10;  F --&gt; G{该绑定是 let?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[泛化自由变量 → 多态 scheme]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| I[保持单态]&#10;  H --&gt; J[标注最一般类型]&#10;  I --&gt; J\">flowchart TD\n  A[表达式 AST] --&gt; B[为每个子式引入新类型变量]\n  B --&gt; C[遍历 AST 按类型规则收集等式约束]\n  C --&gt; D[合一: 求解约束&lt;br/&gt;构造最一般代换 MGU]\n  D --&gt;|失败| E[类型错误&lt;br/&gt;occurs-check 或冲突]\n  D --&gt;|成功| F[把代换作用到类型变量]\n  F --&gt; G{该绑定是 let?}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[泛化自由变量 → 多态 scheme]\n  G --&gt;|否| I[保持单态]\n  H --&gt; J[标注最一般类型]\n  I --&gt; J</pre><p>下表把 HM 的几个关键操作摆在一起，它们共同支撑起「无注解也能推类型」的魔法。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>失败情形</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类型变量引入</td>\n<td>为未知类型占位</td>\n<td>——</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>约束收集</td>\n<td>把类型规则转成等式</td>\n<td>——</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合一 unification</td>\n<td>解等式，求最一般代换</td>\n<td>构造子冲突（int vs bool）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>occurs-check</td>\n<td>防止 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a = a \\to b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 这类无限类型</td>\n<td>形成循环则报错</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>泛化 generalization</td>\n<td>把自由变量提升为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>——</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实例化 instantiation</td>\n<td>用新变量替换 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span></span></span></span></span> 绑定的变量</td>\n<td>——</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"合一-约束求解的引擎\">合一：约束求解的引擎</h2><p>合一是 HM 的心脏。给定两个含变量的类型，合一试图找出一个代换（substitution）——把类型变量映射到具体类型——使两者相等，且这个代换是「最一般」的（most general unifier，MGU），即不做任何多余的具体化。规则很简洁：两个相同的基础类型直接成功；变量与任意类型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 合一就记下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>↦</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\mapsto \\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.522em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↦</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>；两个构造类型（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_1 \\to \\tau_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_1 \\to \\sigma_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）则递归合一对应分量。</p>\n<p>合一中有一道不可省略的检查——occurs-check：当要把变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 绑定到一个含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 自身的类型（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>↦</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\mapsto a \\to b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.522em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↦</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>）时必须拒绝，否则会得到无限大的类型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">((\\ldots \\to b) \\to b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">((</span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。省掉它会让推断在某些程序上不终止。著名的 Algorithm W 就是把约束收集与合一交织在一次自底向上的遍历里，边走边解；另一种风格 Algorithm M（自顶向下）与「先全量收集约束、再统一求解」的现代做法各有取舍，后者更利于产出好的错误信息。Max Bernstein 在 2024 年的一篇广为流传的教程里就并列实现了 W 与基于约束的两种风格，印证了二者至今仍是教学与实现的主流（来源：bernsteinbear.com《Damas-Hindley-Milner inference two ways》）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"合一算法与-occurs-check\">合一算法与 occurs-check</h3><p>把上面几条规则写成代码，核心不过是对两个类型做结构递归。<code>occurs-check</code> 就在「变量绑定」那一支里。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"unify(t1, t2, S):&#10;  t1 = walk(t1, S); t2 = walk(t2, S)     # 先解掉已知代换&#10;  if t1 == t2:            return S        # 相同 → 成功&#10;  if t1 is Var(a):&#10;    if occurs(a, t2):     fail(&quot;无限类型&quot;)  # 防止 a ↦ a→b&#10;    return S ∪ {a ↦ t2}&#10;  if t2 is Var(a):&#10;    if occurs(a, t1):     fail(&quot;无限类型&quot;)&#10;    return S ∪ {a ↦ t1}&#10;  if t1 is Fn(p1,r1) and t2 is Fn(p2,r2):&#10;    S = unify(p1, p2, S)                  # 分量递归合一&#10;    return unify(r1, r2, S)&#10;  fail(&quot;构造子冲突&quot;)                       # 如 int vs bool&#10;&#10;occurs(a, t):  return a 出现在 t 的结构中\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>unify(t1, t2, S):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  t1 = walk(t1, S); t2 = walk(t2, S)     # 先解掉已知代换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if t1 == t2:            return S        # 相同 → 成功</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if t1 is Var(a):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if occurs(a, t2):     fail(\"无限类型\")  # 防止 a ↦ a→b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return S ∪ {a ↦ t2}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if t2 is Var(a):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if occurs(a, t1):     fail(\"无限类型\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return S ∪ {a ↦ t1}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if t1 is Fn(p1,r1) and t2 is Fn(p2,r2):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    S = unify(p1, p2, S)                  # 分量递归合一</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return unify(r1, r2, S)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  fail(\"构造子冲突\")                       # 如 int vs bool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>occurs(a, t):  return a 出现在 t 的结构中</span></span></code></pre></div><p>去掉 <code>occurs</code> 那一支，<code>unify</code> 会在构造循环类型时陷入无限递归——这正是「不可省略」的工程含义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"let-多态与泛化时机\">let-多态与泛化时机</h2><p>HM 的多态全靠 <code>let</code> 这一个构造引入，所以又叫 let-多态。差别在于：函数参数（lambda 绑定）是<strong>单态</strong>的——同一个 lambda 内部，参数变量在所有使用点必须是同一个类型；而 <code>let</code> 绑定是<strong>多态</strong>的——绑定的值会被泛化，每个使用点可独立实例化。这就是为什么</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>let </mtext><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> in </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mtext> </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mtext> true</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{let } id = \\lambda x. x \\text{ in } (id\\ 1,\\ id\\ \\text{true})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">let </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> in </span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">true</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>能通过检查（<code>id</code> 在两处分别实例化为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>int</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>int</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{int}\\to\\text{int}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">int</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">int</span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>bool</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>bool</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{bool}\\to\\text{bool}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bool</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bool</span></span></span></span></span></span>），而把 <code>id</code> 换成 lambda 参数则不行。泛化有个微妙的约束：只能泛化那些「不被当前上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span></span></span></span></span> 捕获」的自由类型变量，否则会推出错误的多态类型。这与 <a href=\"../foundations/symbol-tables-scoping\">符号表与作用域解析</a> 里上下文的范围概念紧密相关。</p>\n<h3 id=\"泛化与实例化的一对操作\">泛化与实例化的一对操作</h3><p><code>let</code> 引入多态靠两个互为逆操作的动作：赋值时把自由变量「打包」成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span></span></span></span></span>，使用时再把它们「拆」成新变量。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"generalize(Γ, t):                       # let 绑定时调用&#10;  vars = freeVars(t) \\ freeVars(Γ)      # 只打包不被上下文捕获的变量&#10;  return ∀ vars. t                      # → type scheme&#10;&#10;instantiate(σ):                         # 每个使用点调用&#10;  if σ is ∀ a1..an. t:&#10;    return t[a1 := fresh1, ..., an := freshn]   # 换一批全新变量&#10;  return σ&#10;&#10;-- 例：let id = λx. x in (id 1, id true)&#10;generalize(Γ, a → a)      → ∀a. a → a&#10;instantiate(∀a. a → a)    → a1 → a1     # 第一处使用&#10;instantiate(∀a. a → a)    → a2 → a2     # 第二处使用，各推各的\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>generalize(Γ, t):                       # let 绑定时调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  vars = freeVars(t) \\ freeVars(Γ)      # 只打包不被上下文捕获的变量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return ∀ vars. t                      # → type scheme</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>instantiate(σ):                         # 每个使用点调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if σ is ∀ a1..an. t:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return t[a1 := fresh1, ..., an := freshn]   # 换一批全新变量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return σ</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 例：let id = λx. x in (id 1, id true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>generalize(Γ, a → a)      → ∀a. a → a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>instantiate(∀a. a → a)    → a1 → a1     # 第一处使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>instantiate(∀a. a → a)    → a2 → a2     # 第二处使用，各推各的</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两处使用拿到的是彼此独立的类型变量，所以 <code>id 1</code> 与 <code>id true</code> 互不干扰——若把 <code>id</code> 换成 lambda 参数（单态，只有 <code>generalize</code> 不生效），两处就必须共享同一个变量，于是报冲突。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推断的边界-从-hm-到现实语言\">推断的边界：从 HM 到现实语言</h2><p>纯 HM 优雅且无须注解，但它的表达力恰好卡在「让推断保持可判定」的那条线上。一旦语言想要更强的特性，全自动推断就力不从心：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>高阶多态（rank-N polymorphism）</strong>：函数参数本身是多态的，此时类型推断不可判定，必须靠程序员补注解。</li>\n<li><strong>子类型</strong>：HM 的合一基于「相等」，而 <a href=\"subtyping-coercion\">子类型与隐式转换</a> 需要的是「子类型关系」，二者难以直接融合，往往要改用约束求解。</li>\n<li><strong>重载 / 类型类</strong>：同名多实现迫使推断引入限定类型（qualified types），如 Haskell 的 <code>Eq a =&gt; a -&gt; a -&gt; Bool</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>正因如此，工业语言极少采用纯 HM，而是「局部推断 + 注解兜底」：TypeScript、Rust、Swift、C++ 的 <code>auto</code> 都只在局部（变量初始化、上下文期望已知处）推断，跨函数边界则要求注解。这种务实取舍把推断的便利与可判定性的保证结合起来，也直接催生了 <a href=\"../practice/gradual-bidirectional\">渐进与双向类型检查</a> 那套「检查与综合双向流动」的工程方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>类型推断为类型规则补上缺失的类型，HM 的三步是：引入类型变量、收集约束、用合一求解，必要时泛化为多态。</li>\n<li>合一寻找使两类型相等的最一般代换；occurs-check 阻止无限类型，是不可省略的一步。</li>\n<li>Algorithm W 把收集与合一交织在自底向上遍历中；现代实现常先全量收集约束再求解，以产出更好的错误信息。</li>\n<li>let-多态是 HM 多态的唯一来源：lambda 参数单态、let 绑定多态；泛化只能作用于不被上下文捕获的自由变量。</li>\n<li>纯 HM 卡在可判定性边界，遇到高阶多态、子类型、重载即力不从心；工业语言因此采用「局部推断 + 注解兜底」的务实方案。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"类型推断","id":"类型推断"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"合一：约束求解的引擎","id":"合一-约束求解的引擎"},{"level":3,"text":"合一算法与 occurs-check","id":"合一算法与-occurs-check"},{"level":2,"text":"let-多态与泛化时机","id":"let-多态与泛化时机"},{"level":3,"text":"泛化与实例化的一对操作","id":"泛化与实例化的一对操作"},{"level":2,"text":"推断的边界：从 HM 到现实语言","id":"推断的边界-从-hm-到现实语言"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"类型规则与判断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/type-checking-semantic-analysis/type-checking/type-rules-judgments"},"next":{"title":"子类型与隐式转换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/type-checking-semantic-analysis/type-checking/subtyping-coercion"}}